Pusula model weights are LoRA adapters and a code readout trained on top of vllm-sr/d3 (Pusula),
a fully fine-tuned Qwen3.5-0.8B in the d3 format (Pusula Mini) and a fine-tuned TabiBERT cross-encoder
(Pusula Nano). Their training data was generated synthetically; it contains no scraped or personal data.
